#
# foobar
#! doc comment
from t # trailing
"a" # it's "quoted"

----------------------------------------------------

[
	["comment", "#"],
	["comment", "# foobar"],
	["doc-comment", "#! doc comment"],
	["builtin", "from"], " t ", ["comment", "# trailing"],
	["string", "\"a\""], ["comment", "# it's \"quoted\""]
]

----------------------------------------------------

Checks for comments and doc comments.
